Track body temperature. Take care of yourself.
With our app, you can discover if you're having a fever. Get real-time temperature readings with just a tap on your mobile device, and share your status with your family.


With Body Temperature, you can:


Measure your body temperature;
Track your symptoms and meds;
- Save your data to Apple Health or get your temperature from Apple Health; 
- See the beautiful graphs and stats;
- Share your status with family members;
- Export the status to PDF;
- Check your temperature with your thermometer and save your readings on Apple Watch app;
- Learn how weather can affect your body temperature with our widget.


Simple beautiful app for your health!




